  "title": "Stuffing without a Turkey",
  "description": "This savory casserole is made with browned ground beef, stuffing mix, and fried potatoes livened up with chopped olives, pickles, and pimentos, and then baked until golden brown and crispy.",
  "authors": [
    "BALIA"
